<object #flow.definition apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "entity" fact_grade = "authoritative_fact" single_writer = "modeling://domain/flow/definition_owner" } [
  <desc ?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC60>
  Flow definition 是可版本化的 canonical XNL 事实，包含产品根、唯一 FlowContract、声明顺序和结构子域；运行实例、布局和渲染结果不属于 definition。
  </?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC60>
  <types ?t>
  interface FlowDefinition {
    fqn: string
    form: FlowProductForm
    contract: FlowContract
    statements: readonly FlowStatement[]
  }
  </?t>
  <invariants ?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC61>
  根产品决定可用 profile；FlowContract 的 id 必须等于根 FQN；定义事实不得携带运行期 snapshot、画布布局或 surface view。
  </?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC61>
]>

<enum #flow.product_profile apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "enum" } [
  <types ?t>
  type FlowProductForm = "InstantCtrlFlow" | "WorkCtrlFlow" | "BPCtrlFlow" | "EagerDataFlow"
  </?t>
]>

<component #flow.ctrl_flow_statement apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "component" } [
  <desc ?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC62>
  CtrlFlow statement 以统一的输入/输出数据链表达编排；不同产品只通过 capability profile 选择可用节点和生命周期。
  </?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC62>
  <runtime ?r>
  type Runtime = ScopeRuntime
  </?r>
  <input ?i>
  type Input = unknown
  </?i>
  <config ?c>
  type Config = Readonly<Record<string, unknown>>
  </?c>
  <output ?o>
  type Output = unknown
  </?o>
  <pseudo { kind = "ctrl" } ?p>
  statement → output = fn(runtime, input, config) → next statement / branch / completion
  </?p>
]>

<port #flow.definition_owner apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "port" } [
  <desc ?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC63>
  definition owner 负责把经验证的 XNL mutation 批次写入 canonical definition；它不写 runtime facts 或 editor layout。
  </?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC63>
  <types ?t>
  interface DefinitionWriter { dryRun(batch: XnlMutation[]): Candidate; commit(batch: XnlMutation[]): AcceptedDefinition }
  </?t>
  <command ?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC64>
  definition.configure、node.insert、node.move、node.delete、structure.configure
  </?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC64>
]>

<state-machine #flow.runtime_lifecycle apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "state-machine" } [
  <mermaid ?m>
  stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Running
    Running --> Waiting: ExternalJob / Timer / TaskStep
    Waiting --> Running: ResumeSignal / task operation
    Running --> Completed: Return
    Running --> Failed: technical fault
    Waiting --> Failed: deadline / cancellation
    Completed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
  </?m>
  <invariants ?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC65>
  InstantCtrlFlow 不进入 Waiting；WorkCtrlFlow 持久化等待、attempt、deadline、lane 和 winner；BPCtrlFlow 额外持久化 TaskSpace 任务事实。
  </?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC65>
]>

<object #flow.eager_data_graph apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "entity" fact_grade = "authoritative_fact" single_writer = "modeling://domain/flow/definition_owner" } [
  <desc ?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC66>
  EagerDataFlow 是基于 data edge 和 waitFor completion edge 的 eager DAG；它与 CtrlFlow 的顺序控制语义正交。
  </?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC66>
  <types ?t>
  interface EagerDataFlowNode { id: string; inputs?: Record<string, string>; outputs?: readonly string[]; waitFor?: readonly string[] }
  </?t>
  <invariants ?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC67>
  flow-port:// 引用端口输出；flow-node:// 引用节点完成事实；节点输出和 completion 不得被渲染器重新解释。
  </?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC67>
]>

<not-owned-here apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" ?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC68>
WorkCtrlFlow/BPCtrlFlow 的 snapshot、WaitHandle、TaskSpace 和 scheduler 是 runtime-control fact；编辑器位置、viewport、pin layout 是 surface_view，均不在此 context 写入。
</?01M0NJZ4P2A6MSFG1GQCMRKC68>
